            "review_title": "Review at Hakata Ineya Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Kim H\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam27 contributions\n0\nEverything is good, the price is worth it.\nMar 2026 • Family\nRecently, the restaurant has reopened to the bustle of Ngô Văn Năm area, in addition to the soup restaurant we cattle or eat, now there is another Japanese restaurant. See the restaurant outside without bars, step into the west and want to close the table &.& The price here is equal to Hokkaido Sachi, not too expensive. Meal we go back to eat 5 sashimi ~~ minus point (with me thui) is here no sushi, some salty vs main dish\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten March 28, 2026",
